WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.423
Unit ten. Taking a Photo!

2
00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:08.809
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:11.669
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.719 --> 00:00:15.179
Today we learn about Taking a Photo. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:20.301
Camera. Say it with me. Camera!

6
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:27.677
Photo. Say it with me. Photo!

7
00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:35.088
Smile. Say it with me. Smile!

8
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:42.183
Click. Say it with me. Click!

9
00:00:45.676 --> 00:00:49.442
Picture. Say it with me. Picture!

10
00:00:52.889 --> 00:00:56.422
Save. Say it with me. Save!

11
00:00:59.923 --> 00:01:03.649
Flash. Say it with me. Flash!

12
00:01:07.205 --> 00:01:11.111
Capture. Say it with me. Capture!

13
00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:23.007
I use a camera to take a photo. I smile and click the button to capture the picture. I can save my photo to look at later.

14
00:01:23.057 --> 00:01:26.417
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:27.172 --> 00:01:32.508
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:33.708
Smile!

17
00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:40.333
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.383 --> 00:01:41.533
Flash!

19
00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:50.051
Did you know? The very first photograph ever taken needed about 8 hours to capture just one image!

20
00:01:50.101 --> 00:01:52.585
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.405 --> 00:02:01.621
Think and answer. What would you like to take a photo of today?

22
00:02:01.671 --> 00:02:02.821
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.867 --> 00:02:09.298
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.348 --> 00:02:12.487
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

